<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25 lower. Trading moderately active. Top $57.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   56.75-57.25</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   56.25-56.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   55.25-56.25</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   54.25-55.25</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   53.25-54.25</p>
<p>Sows 300-500 lbs steady to 0.50 lower; 500-650 lbs fully steady.</p>
<p>Top 54.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    48.50</p>
<p>     few  450-500 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    51.00-53.00</p>
<p>some over 650 lbs 54.00</p>
</text>
